" height=\"145\"></p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) <span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\">What is the differentiation of y ? where &nbsp;<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_DIK9DLb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"108\"></span>", "option1": "1/{2(1 + x<sup>2</sup><span id=\"mce_1_end\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>)}", "option2": "1/{2(1 - x<sup>2</sup>)}<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "1/{2(1 + 2x<sup>2</sup>)}<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "1/{2(2 + x<sup>2</sup>)}<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/n72.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"245\"></p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) <span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\">What is the differentiation of y ? where&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_5I9q7E0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"286\" height=\"57\"></span>", "option1": "2/√(1 + x<sup>2</sup>)<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option2": "2/√(1 - 3x<sup>2</sup>)<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "2/√(1 - 2x<sup>2</sup>)<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "2/√(1 - x<sup>2</sup>)<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/n73.PNG\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) <span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\">What is the value of g when f(b) - f(a) = (b - a)f´ (g) and f(x)= √x , a = 4, b = 9</span>", "option1": "23/4<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option2": "25/4<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "33/4<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "23/2<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/n74.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"794\" height=\"286\"></p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) <span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\">What is the value of θ? when f(a + h) = f(a) + h f‘(a + θh) and f(x) = √x , a = 1, h = 3</span>", "option1": "55/12<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option2": "5/4<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "33/4<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "5/12<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/n75.PNG\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) What is the value of y<sub>n +1</sub>? Where y = x<sup>n</sup> lnx", "option1": "(n + 1)!/x<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option2": "n/x!<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "n!/x<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "n/2<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/n76.PNG\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) <span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\">If a function f is continuous in the closed interval [a ,b] , differentiate in the open interval (a ,b) and f(a) = f(b), then there exist least one point c ∈ (a ,b) such that f‘(c) = 0 is called ?&nbsp;</span>", "option1": "Mean value theorem<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option2": "Taylor’s theorem<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "Role’s theorem<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "Maclaurin’s theorem<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>Sl<sup>n</sup> : If a function f is continuous in the closed interval [a ,b] , differentiable in the open interval (a ,b) and f(a) = f(b), then there exist least one point c ∈ (a, b) such that f’(c) = 0 is called Role’s theorem</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) <span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\">If a function f is continuous in the closed interval [a ,b] , differentiate in the open interval (a ,b), then there exist least one point c ∈ (a ,b) such that f′(c) ={f(b) - f(a)}/(b - a) is called ?</span>", "option1": "Mean value theorem<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option2": "Taylor’s theorem<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "Role’s theorem<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "Maclaurin’s theorem<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>Sl<sup>n</sup> :If a function f is continuous in the closed interval [a ,b] , differentiate in the open interval (a ,b), then there exist least one point c ∈ (a ,b) such that f’(c)=(f(b)-f(a))/(b-a) is called Mean value theorem.</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) <span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\">What is the necessary condition for the existence of maximum value and minimum value of the differentiate equation y = f(x)?</span>", "option1": "(dy/dx) ≠ 0<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option2": "(dy/dx) &gt; 0<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "(dy/dx) &lt; 0<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "(dy/dx) = 0<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>Sl<sup>n</sup> : the necessary condition for the existence of maximum value and minimum value of the differentiate equation y=f(x) is dy/dx=0</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) <span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\">What is the critical point (সন্ধি বিন্দু) of the equation, f(x) = x<sup>3 </sup>- 9x<sup>2 </sup>+ 15x - 3</span>", "option1": "1, 2<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option2": "1, 3<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "1, 5<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "1, 7<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/n77.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"397\" height=\"162\"></p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) <span id=\"mce_1_start\">What is the minimum value (লঘিষ্ঠ মান) of y = x<sup>x</sup></span>", "option1": "(1/3e)<sup>(1/e)</sup>", "option2": "(1/2e)<sup>(1/e)</sup><span id=\"mce_1_start\"></spa